  DesignerSolution: "Gi\u1EDBi thi\u1EC7u duy nh\u1EA5t: kho\u1EA3ng c\xE1ch t\u1EDBi
    t\xE2m quay l\xE0m thay \u0111\u1ED5i m\xF4 men c\u1EE7a hai bi b\u1EB1ng nhau;
    ch\u01B0a th\xEAm n\xFAt ho\u1EB7c c\u1EEDa. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P18 \u2014 \u0111\xF2n
    b\u1EA9y ng\u1EAFn, A \u0111\xE3 n\u1EB1m trong v\xF9ng d\u1EC5 gi\u1EEF, ch\u1EC9
    di chuy\u1EC3n A t\u1EEB g\u1EA7n t\xE2m ra xa.\nRecovery: Hai m\xE1ng r\u1ED9ng
    c\xF3 th\xE0nh cu\u1ED1i gi\u1EEF bi; \u0111i\u1EC3m n\xE2ng c\xF3 ch\u1ED1t
    \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc, kh\xF4ng y\xEAu c\u1EA7u c\u0103n c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 h\u1EB9p"
